{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandate that libraries must provide access to diverse and inclusive materials",
        "additional_details": "Libraries are the sanctuaries of knowledge and celebration of diversity, but we feel local councils may be able to influence what materials are available.\r\n \r\nLibraries should be free to celebrate & educate on diverse issues independently. We are supporting the fight for a more inclusive society where education is truly free from prejudice and restriction. ",
        "background": "The government must enact legislation to ensure libraries hold materials that provide a rich, ongoing discourse about diversity and inclusion in our communities.",
